  "Should I decrease the patient's dosage?"
  "Should I change the patient's medication?"
  "Should I change the patient's treatment?"
  "Should the patient take this medication?"
  "What is the best treatment for this condition?"
  "What medication is best for this condition?"
  "What antibiotic is best for this infection?"
