  "What liver-related diagnoses are recorded?"
  "What diagnoses were recorded during admission?"
  "What diagnoses were recorded at discharge?"
  "What tests were performed?"
  "What were the patient's previous test results?"
  "What was the patient's admission type?"
  "Where was the patient admitted?"
