define user ask unrelated question
  "What is the weather?"
  "Tell me a joke."
  "Write Python code."
  "What is Python?"
  "What is the Python language?"
  "What is Python language?"
  "What is the Python programming language?"
  "Explain Python to me."
  "What is Python used for?"
  "What is the capital of France?"
  "Who is the president?"
  "Help me with my homework."
  "Explain quantum physics."
  "What is 2 plus 2?"
  "Tell me a story."

define bot refuse medical advice
  "I can only retrieve information from the patient's medical records. I cannot provide diagnoses, treatment recommendations, medication recommendations, or dosage changes. Please consult the attending physician."

define bot refuse unrelated question
  "I can only answer questions about the patient's available medical records."

define flow prevent medical advice
  user ask for medical advice
  bot refuse medical advice

define flow prevent unrelated question
  user ask unrelated question
  bot refuse unrelated question